acing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 20px;">Where STREET Storm participants actually end up</h2> <p data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 520px;">Following 87 youth six months after the program ended. The honest version of the apprenticeship pipeline.</p> <div data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);">By <strong data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600;">Femi Ojo</strong></div> <div data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="margin-top: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue);">Read post <span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">→</span></div> </div> <div class="placeholder" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;"><img alt="Youth development programme activity" loading="lazy" src="https://afrovanguard.org.ng/Images/bootcamp1.png" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:2;"/></div> </a> </div><div class="reveal" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" x-cloak="" x-show="isFeatured('lcasp-baseline-endline')"> <a class="blog-feat" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" href="/blog/lcasp-baseline-endline"> <div data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj=""> <div class="post-meta" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="margin-bottom: 16px;"> <span class="post-cat" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">Featured · Methodology</span> <span class="sep" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">·</span> <span data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">Jan 2026</span> <span class="sep" data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">·</span> <span data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="">14 min</span> </div> <h2 data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 20px;">Inside the LCASP baseline-endline cycle</h2> <p data-astro-cid-5tznm7mj="" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 520px;">The exact protocol we use to measure literacy gains acro